<p>
<b>STANFORD EE/CS JOURNAL</b>
</p></div>

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: center; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
SUBMISSION GUIDELINES
</p></div>



<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Thank you for your interest in making a submission to the Stanford ECJ!  This document is meant to give you a few guidelines to follow as you prepare you paper.  If you have any questions that are not addressed here, please feel free to contact me at <a href="mailto:wliou@stanford.edu"><font color="Blue"><u>wliou@stanford.edu</u></font></a>, or to visit our website at <a href="http://ieee.stanford.edu/ecj"><font color="Blue"><u>http://ieee.stanford.edu/ecj</u></font></a> for examples of past submissions.
</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
I wish you all the best of luck, and I look forward to publishing your papers in our next issue.
</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Will Liou
</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Editor-in-Chief, 2004-2005
</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>






<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>



<p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 2.08mm 0.00mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
<i>Technology in Society Articles</i><i></i>
</p></div>



<ul>
<li value="1"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
1-2 page maximum
</p></div></li>



<li value="2"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Will be reviewed by ECJ staff
</p></div></li>



<li value="3"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Suggested content: social impact and/or significance of emerging technologies
</p></div></li>



<li value="4"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
MS Word format acceptable
</p></div></li>



<li value="5"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Submit all image files separately in JPEG format
</p></div></li>



</ul>

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>



<p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 2.08mm 0.00mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
<i>Short </i><i>Technical </i><i>Papers</i><i></i>
</p></div>



<ul>
<li value="6"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
2-3 page maximum
</p></div></li>



<li value="7"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Will be reviewed by ECJ staff
</p></div></li>



<li value="8"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Suggested content: undergraduate research projects (CURIS, REU, etc.), early-stage research and results
</p></div></li>



<li value="9"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
MS Word format acceptable
</p></div></li>



<li value="10"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Submit all image files separately in JPEG format
</p></div></li>



</ul>

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>



<p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 2.08mm 0.00mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
<i>Long </i><i>Technical Papers</i>
</p></div>



<ul>
<li value="1"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
6-8 page maximum
</p></div></li>



<li value="2"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Will be reviewed by at least two faculty members from the EE and/or CS departments 
</p></div></li>



<li value="3"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Suggested content: excerpts or modifications of longer papers that were submitted to other journals, drafts of papers to be submitted to proper technical journals
</p></div></li>



<li value="4"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Papers should be prepared in LaTeX; template files are available on the ECJ website at <a href="http://ieee.stanford.edu/ecj/"><font color="Blue"><u>http://ieee.stanford.edu/ecj/</u></font></a>
</p></div></li>



<li value="5"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Pictures/images must be in CMYK (not RGB) color format
</p></div></li>



<li value="6"><p><div name="Normal" align="left" style="margin: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 12.50mm;  padding: 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm 0.00mm; "> 

<p style="text-indent: -6.25mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
MATLAB plots and other figures must be in EPS format
</p></div></li>



</ul>

<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">

</p></div>





<p style="text-indent: 0.00mm; text-align: left; line-height: 4.166667mm; color: Black; background-color: White; ">
Please send your submission to <a href="mailto:ieee@ee.stanford.edu"><font color="Blue"><u>ieee@ee.stanford.edu</u></font></a> by 11:59PM on <b>FRIDAY, DECEMBER 10</b><b>, 2004</b>.  Extensions may be considered on a case-by-case basis (contact Will at <a href="mailto:wliou@stanford.edu"><font color="Blue"><u>wliou@stanford.edu</u></font></a>).
</p></div>

